{"start":"t:body","attrs":{}}
{"text":"\n      "}
{"start":"t:div","attrs":{"facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n68.jpg"}}
{"text":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"91","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/91"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/91/1","n":"1"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"As one who sits in the protection of the Most High and shelters in the shadow of the Almighty, "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/91/2","n":"2"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"I say to "}
{"start":"t:pb","attrs":{"ed":"1965","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n70.jpg","n":"20"}}
{"end":"t:pb"}
{"tail":"the Lord: My refuge and my fortress, my God in whom I trust. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/91/3","n":"3"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"For He saves you from the snare of the fowler, from destructive plague. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/91/4","n":"4"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"With His wing He covers you, you shelter under His wings, His faithfulness is shield and buckler. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/91/5","n":"5"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"You shall not fear the terror of night, the arrow that flies by day, "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/91/6","n":"6"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"the plague that creeps in the dark, the pestilence that flares up at noon. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/91/7","n":"7"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Though a thousand fall at your side and ten thousand on your right, to you it will not approach. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/91/8","n":"8"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"You need only look with your eyes and you will see the recompense of the wicked. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/91/9","n":"9"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"For Thou, O Lord, art my trust — on high hast Thou placed Thy dwelling. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/91/10","n":"10"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"No misfortune will befall you, no plague will come near your tent. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/91/11","n":"11"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"For He will command His angels concerning you to guard you in all your ways. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/91/12","n":"12"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"On hands will they bear you lest your foot be bruised by a stone. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/91/13","n":"13"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Though you tread on the lion and viper and trample on the whelp and the crocodile. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/91/14","n":"14"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"For because he delighted in Me I delivered him; I shall raise him up because he acknowledged my Name. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/91/15","n":"15"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"When he calls me, I will answer him, I am with him in distress, I save him and honour him. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/91/16","n":"16"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"With length of days will I satisfy him and I will let him see my salvation. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n      "}
{"end":"t:div"}
{"tail":"\n    "}
{"end":"t:body"}
